    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="bd1816ec-474b-5b53-a78d-dfb3b73a22eb" activityNameId="5e67ccc1-4658-5b3c-90dc-46dcee384356" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Wind power plant 2MW, offshore, moving parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Wind power plant 2MW, offshore, moving parts
Lifetime is assumed to be 20 years. Annual electricity production is assumed to be 5.6 GWh. Data are from a plant of the type "Bonus 2 MW", installed at the wind park Middelgrunden on the coast of Denmark.;
UUID: b3fd9908-a6f1-3ab8-98b0-d6f6164f273f
Includes materials used for moving parts: rotor, nacelle, electric parts, transformer, and their disposal. Also includes the prozessing, the energy requirements for assembling, the transports needed, and  the connection to the grid.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average European technology for a 2 MW offshore wind power plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b3fd9908-a6f1-3ab8-98b0-d6f6164f273f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
